WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:07.110
<b>Episode 24: That Which Ends and That Which Continues</b>

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:12.030
I...

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.170
Samidare,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.100
good work.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:16.950
Also, welcome back.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.080
Welcome back.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.240
Welcome back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.570
Sami-chan, I'm sorry.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:22.660
Welcome back.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.040
Good work.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.170
Welcome back.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.610
Good work.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:27.450
Welcome back.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:28.840
Welcome back.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.050
W-Welcome back.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.140
I... I...

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.090
I'm sorry!

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:39.500
I'm sorry!

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:41.720
Thank you!

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:43.730
I'm sorry.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:44.640
Thank you.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.560
I'm back.

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.650
Thank you.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.300
Thank you.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.780
All done, Samidare?

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:56.700
Yeah.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:58.870
Let's go home, everyone.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:06.290
This is where we fought the eleventh?

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:10.350
That artificial island we were 
on before will soon crumble.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:13.210
Now that Samidare's resolve has been broken,

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:16.490
<i>When I looked up, 
that sky was full of wonders.</i>

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:14.810
that power is left adrift.

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:16.820
Soon enough that will 
disintegrate into pieces

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:21.520
<i>The despair I bottled up tormented me,</i>

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.150
small enough to burn up in the atmosphere

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:20.640
and fade from the sky.

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:25.480
From now on, it's just 
the stories of your lives.

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:25.500
<i>and I wanted the courage 
to break my chains of isolation.</i>

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.850
<i>(You are my light)</i>

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:32.040
This battle was merely a single 
episode in the long lives you'll live.

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:32.530
<i>I was searching for your 
brilliant light in my hazy dreams</i>

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:36.700
<i>to kick away the limits placed on myself.</i>

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:35.070
However, things were gained,

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:36.320
things were lost,

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.720
<i>Now with your courage, 
let's soar into the sky.</i>

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:38.530
and you met some who will be forgotten,

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:40.740
and some who never will.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:44.290
<i>Let's CRUSH the fear!</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.140
Please forgive me for all 
the trouble I've caused you.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:49.500
<i>I swear to you, at the ends 
of this chaotic world,</i>

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.880
No, you've done a lot for us, Anima.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.800
Good work, Anima.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.250
<i>that even if you fall, I'll</i>

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:52.150
Good work.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.610
<i>Be the HERO!</i>

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.590
Anima, thank you.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.450
Good work, Anima.

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:59.650
<i>I'll be waiting at the future 
we're moving toward,</i>

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:59.640
Raise your head, Anima. You did well.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.610
Thank you for everything.

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:03.650
<i>with a “YES, MY LORD!” 
for your constant radiance,</i>

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:03.640
Thank you, Anima.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:04.890
Thank you.

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:07.630
<i>clutching the stars raining down upon us.</i>

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:06.440
Thank you.

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:15.490
<i>I'll love you until we reach 
that future you want to destroy.</i>

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:29.910
Princess!

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:34.240
Looks like I'm not the princess anymore.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.710
My psychic power's gone.

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.430
T-To the hospital!

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.380
I'm okay.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:45.720
I was shocked when that great power left me,

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.870
but I seem to be fine for now.

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:49.140
But...

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.990
I mean it.

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:52.940
Strangely enough, I feel good.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.840
Though, if my power's gone, 
then that means...

00:02:58.260 --> 00:02:59.460
it's almost time.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:00.810
Yeah.

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:04.410
It's almost time to say goodbye.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.040
Lance?!

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:07.950
Zan!

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:08.870
Ludo.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.040
<i>That dog was my brother's...?</i>

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:13.980
To those of you who gained 
psychic power through your wishes

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:16.480
like Shimaki Hyou and Akane Taiyou,

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:19.340
and those of you who already had 
a strong potential to develop them

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:21.990
like Hoshikawa Subaru, 
Tsukishiro Yukimachi, and Samidare,

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:26.390
I'm sorry, but I'll be taking all 
of your psychic powers with me.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.900
W-We had potential?

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.910
It's a little late now...

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:33.810
What will you do after this?

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:37.650
I'll take the Ring Squires with me 
and search for the Ring of Reincarnation.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.490
Reincarnation?

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:41.830
I've lived too long, as well.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:45.550
This form is mostly spiritual, 
held together by psychic powers.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:48.130
I'm tired.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.500
Thank you for everything, Sia.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.250
I enjoyed our life together.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:59.670
Yako, can you take photos by yourself? 
Will you be okay?

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.880
I'll be all right.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.520
Farewell, Yako.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.470
Goodbye, Kuh.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.210
Thank you.

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.490
And good work.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.980
Hyou-kun, take care.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.270
I always take care.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:18.830
Sorry, Kuh.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:20.670
Could you carry Kir for me?

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.240
No problem.

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:26.270
Farewell, brave and mighty warrior,

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:27.660
Sorano Hanako.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.390
Bye-bye.

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:31.450
Try not to fight with Lance.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:33.480
I appreciate the advice.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:38.240
It's rare to see you grateful.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.460
I'm sorry for everything.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.550
What are you saying?! You didn't—!

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:46.890
Take care.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.610
Loki, thank you for everything.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:50.950
Goodbye.

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:53.890
Don't cry, or you'll embarrass yourself.

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.410
I'm not crying!

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:57.060
I wouldn't cry!

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.150
I'll miss you, Ly.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:02.160
Don't cry, my Subaru! Or I'll—

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.490
Damn it!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.400
Thank you for always 
being there for me, Long.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.010
It gave me courage.

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:12.040
You always gave me courage, too, 
my cute Yukimachi.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.850
Want a ride?

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.100
Dance...

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.300
Thank you.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:19.680
Become a great woman!

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:21.860
I mean, you already are, but you know!

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.320
Goodbye!

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:27.300
I'm sure you two will be 
fine together. Goodbye.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.670
You're okay letting them on your back?

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:30.830
It's an exception.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.010
Farewell.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:36.700
Farewell.

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:44.120
Neu.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.360
Mu.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:49.840
Anima.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.810
Hey, sorry, but...

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.530
I can't believe you two.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:57.040
You're not exhausted?

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.360
What's going on?

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.170
Are they really?

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.380
Huh?

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.900
You tired?

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:04.800
Not at all!

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.620
All right.

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:09.990
I'll save your psychic powers for last.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:12.220
Have a big farewell party for me.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:12.810
Thank!

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:13.780
You!

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.060
<i>Have I truly become strong?</i>

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:17.730
<i>Time for you to see, Mikazuki!</i>

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:19.900
<i>Show me how strong my brother was,</i>

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:23.070
<i>and how strong we are, Yuu-kun!</i>

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:28.310
Wha? Even after all that?

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:29.030
Huh?

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:32.100
What? Why are those two doing this?

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:36.540
Hmm, it's probably something 
only those two understand.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.890
I even forbade personal fights.

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.640
They're just playing around.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.150
Smile and watch.

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:43.990
Well, it's fine.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:49.800
Thank you for everything, Anima.

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:54.350
The future...

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:57.040
The future isn't set in stone.

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.440
You decide it for yourself!

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.860
You think I can?

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.150
I'm sure.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:11.950
Ah, farewell.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.940
<i>Everyone was crying</i>

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:14.620
Farewell.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:19.390
<i>Like a star burning blue</i>

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:22.790
<i>Where will we go? What will we see?</i>

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:27.570
<i>We're all going to change, though.</i>

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:44.270
Loki!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:44.940
<i>I don't need it, don't want it.</i>

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.910
<i>I've already given up on it</i>

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.650
<i>After so many sad farewells</i>

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:51.130
<i>And "take cares"</i>

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:56.520
<i>I want to like the present more than the past, 
the future more than the present.</i>

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:00.540
<i>Gradually my values have changed</i>

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:03.920
<i>I felt more grown up the more they wore away</i>

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:09.870
<i>Lies and betrayals 
are practically civilities</i>

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:13.380
<i>Everyone ages</i>

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:16.770
<i>But what about the star burning blue?</i>

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.760
Not... yet...

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:20.190
<i>Our likes and dislikes</i>

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:23.810
<i>They'll all change at some point</i>

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:26.650
<i>A worn-out savior</i>

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.190
Meteors.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.190
<i>A medal in a dirty ditch</i>

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:32.270
<i>I don't want to overlook 
their faint glimmers of light</i>

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:30.660
A meteor shower.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.280
It must be what Anima mentioned.

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:36.070
<i>I hear the sound still ringing from them</i>

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.570
It's pretty.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:36.400
A shower...

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:41.120
<i>Let's move on a bit</i>

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:37.760
A shower of lights...

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:39.620
A shower of stars.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:41.120
Stars...

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:42.910
A summer shower of stars.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:47.530
<i>Some people are privileged</i>

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:51.430
<i>and some people are misfortunate.</i>

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.390
How long are they going to keep it up?

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:54.210
<i>What will I be to you</i>

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:54.720
They both have incredible stamina.

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:58.050
<i>after we're swallowed up by fate?</i>

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:58.050
<i>Those two seem like they're having fun.</i>

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:04.750
<i>I feel like there's surprisingly 
more I can easily believe in.</i>

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.870
<i>Life is nothing but hardship 
right now, but I guess...</i>

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:05.150
<i>once I'm an adult, there'll be 
fun things to look forward to.</i>

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:08.180
<i>Everyone ages</i>

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:09.270
<i>Loki, one day I'll be a grown up, too.</i>

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:11.590
<i>But what about the star burning blue?</i>

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:15.070
<i>Our likes and dislikes</i>

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:18.600
<i>They'll all change at some point</i>

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:19.940
Sorry, Yuuhi.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.570
Looks like it's time for goodbye.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.740
Though remember Shinonome-dono's 
techniques aren't psychic powers.

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:29.880
You'll still be able to fight, 
even after I'm gone.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.250
Good luck, Yuuhi.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.130
Neu...

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.580
<i>I want to reach you, I want to tell you,</i>

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.810
I know you.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.440
<i>but it's all so hard.</i>

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:39.720
You're a strong hero who's more 
passionate than anyone else.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:40.790
<i>The world won't let us 
have happiness easily.</i>

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:44.170
Meeting you is something 
I'll take pride in for all eternity.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:46.490
<i>Which is why at present, I want to dream 
of the future more than the present.</i>

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.480
Farewell, Yuuhi.

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:48.300
<i>“I want to run.” “I want to quit.”</i>

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:49.210
I'm proud to be your friend.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.240
<i>How many times have I shouted that?</i>

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:54.690
<i>The light won't stop 
shining brightly down on us.</i>

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:52.420
Thank you.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.360
Farewell.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:10:00.660
<i>By tomorrow I want to be looking 
toward the future from the present.</i>

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.860
I'll never forget you!

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.510
Hey, Mu.

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:02.910
You leaving?

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:07.390
<i>The light of dawn envelops me</i>

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.660
Mikazuki.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:11.990
You used your wish from this life-threatening 
battle to grant bread to a child,

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:10.770
<i>Like the star burning red,</i>

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:14.070
<i>And I hope I can be with you as it flickers</i>

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:15.850
so your heart and body and destiny 
are stronger than anyone else's!

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.800
<i>Because we're all going to change.</i>

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:20.100
I guarantee it. Now make sure you win!

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:20.550
<i>A worn-out savior</i>

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.330
<i>A medal in a dirty ditch</i>

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.450
Leave it to me.

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:26.200
<i>I don't want to overlook 
their faint glimmers of light</i>

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.480
Goodbye.

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:26.780
Mu spoke!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:29.940
<i>I hear the sound still ringing from them</i>

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:28.810
That was a woman's voice.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:35.780
<i>Let's move on a bit</i>

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.990
They've stopped.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.830
Are they finally worn out?

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:51.670
Your face looks awful, Mikazuki.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:55.340
Yours is a pretty sore sight, too, Yuu-kun.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.640
I can't believe you broke my glasses.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.750
Sorry about that.

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.890
Though, I bet your beat up 
face will be real popular.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:06.810
Don't be jealous. 
Yours is beat up and looking good, too.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.840
Of course I'm jealous!

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:12.060
You stole all of the best damn parts today!

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.440
You've got Hakudou and Anima 
fawning over you,

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.190
and you already have the princess, too!

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:19.050
You're pretty popular at college, though!

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.800
You can talk to all kinds of people,

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:21.730
and they love you,

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:24.210
so you have a great time 
every day, don't you?

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:27.390
What's wrong with letting me 
stand out just this once today?!

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:30.460
Don't be jealous, moody four-eyes!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.700
You broke my glasses, 
so now I'm just moody!

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:35.000
What are you going to do about that?!

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.280
Now it's turned into a verbal fight.

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:38.970
Want me to you buy you glasses 
big as milk bottle bottoms?!

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:39.050
What are they even talking about?

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.670
You'll be popular, then!

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.670
Huh?! Don't give me that!

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:40.670
I want to go home and sleep already.

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:43.250
I'll put you down with my next blow!

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:46.470
Bring it! I'll end it 
with my next punch, too!

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:49.640
Wallflower's Jealousy Punch!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:53.060
Popular Bastard's Judgment Punch!

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.810
Huh? Didn't he just say punch?

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.830
Feints are fundamental.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:12.190
I won! Hell yeah!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:14.080
He just beat today's main character.

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:17.500
Amamiya's concentration ran out first.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:20.370
Mikazuki was just one step above him.

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:22.760
Though they were both impressive.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.420
All right, everyone, good work.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:28.970
I'll get in touch again once we settle on 
a time and place for the after party.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:31.820
Okay. I hope we can do it 
before school starts up.

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:33.270
See you later.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:36.320
Ow... Good work.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:37.600
L-Later.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:38.660
Later.

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:42.610
Hakudou-san, you sure you don't want 
to say anything to Amamiya-san?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:45.710
I am. Hey, you want to grab drinks together?

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:47.640
Maybe not right now...

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.860
Mikazuki! You cheater!

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.270
Next is a drinking contest!

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:53.350
Enough already, Yuu-kun.

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:01.580
Thanks for today.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:02.850
It's nothing.

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:05.450
From now on, call me by my name.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:06.760
I'm not the princess anymore.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.680
Oh, right.

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:11.010
Samidare-san.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.720
So awkward.

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:16.410
Yuu-kun, listen,

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:17.830
I don't want to d—

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.810
No, that's not right.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:20.820
I want to live.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:22.580
Yeah.

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.720
That's it.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:26.570
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:28.210
See you tomorrow.

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:34.670
Neu, wake me up at six tomorrow...

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:10.240
<i>It's been ten years since then.</i>

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.660
<i>Whenever I look in the mirror 
lately, I think to myself,</i>

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.290
<i>"This is the same face I saw back then."</i>

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:20.130
<i>Which means maybe it's almost time.</i>

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.130
<i>Anytime now and she'll—</i>

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.010
See, she's here.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:28.150
This is... the inside of Blues.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.340
It's been a long time,

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:33.860
Anima.

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:38.310
Is there anything you'd like 
to ask, Amamiya Yuuhi?

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.480
What's the matter?

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.910
It's just so nostalgic.

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:48.840
I can hardly believe it's 
been ten years since then.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:54.550
So, um... what time are you from, Anima?

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:57.500
I'm from the day of the final battle.

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:02.170
The knights are about to meet up 
and head to the final battlefield.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:05.680
Why did you call me 
from ten years in the future?

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:07.430
I wanted to see your face.

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:09.090
What's that mean?

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:11.010
Well, can you see it?

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:18.790
Was there anything else... 
that I wanted to ask?

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:20.050
Oh, right.

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:23.900
What was the basis you used to select 
Neu and the other Ring Squires?

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:27.000
There seemed to be some meaning 
behind there being twelve of them,

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:29.080
but they aren't the animals 
of either zodiac.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.480
Oh, that?

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:31.930
The moon.

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.100
They were the patterns I saw in the moon

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.950
when I looked out the hospital 
window when I was young.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.360
I never saw a rabbit 
pounding rice cakes, a crab,

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:41.830
or a girl reading a book 
when I looked at it.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:45.230
Animus and I would stay up all night 
talking about what they looked like to us.

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:50.020
It doesn't look like a swordfish 
or a praying mantis to me, either.

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:51.690
That takes me back.

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:56.640
How far in the future did you 
and Animus come from?

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:59.070
We're from the 32nd century.

00:15:59.070 --> 00:15:59.770
Whoa!

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:02.020
That far ahead?!

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:05.800
Though history has already diverged 
from that of the future we're from,

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:07.570
so I don't know what happened to it.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.030
History diverged?

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.850
I changed the life of a brilliant 
scientist from this era

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:15.490
by bringing this battle here.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.260
Asahina Hisame and Shinonome Hangetsu.

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.220
Those two were my ancestors.

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:23.070
Huh?

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:26.670
Animus and I will never 
be born in this history.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:32.610
Huh? But those two only met because 
Shinonome-san became the Dog Knight?

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:30.760
Super Hero
Shinonome Hangetsu

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:33.600
I don't know.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:35.550
Maybe they had another chance to meet.

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:38.300
I see.

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:43.100
I'm glad... those two 
were able to be happy together.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.550
There was a future where that happened.

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:50.550
And in one of those possible futures, 
you were able to become an adult.

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.480
I'm glad about that, too.

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:55.160
How are you doing now?

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:57.260
I'm busy.

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.000
I became a detective.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:02.510
Amamiya! If you're free, 
then go see Nagumo-san!

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:04.110
I'm not free.

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:05.850
It's for work, go.

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:07.080
Yes.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.500
Nagumo

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.500
Detec

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.500
tive

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.500
Agency

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:09.920
Hello.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.840
m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 28 l 0 28

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.840
Hoshikawa Subaru (24)

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.840
Amamiya-san, thanks for your help.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:16.260
m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 28 l 0 28

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:16.260
Nagumo Souichirou (52)

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:16.260
Does Hiwatari have you 
running errands again, Amamiya?

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.610
Yes.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.930
m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 28 l 0 28

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.930
Shinonome Mikazuki (31)

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:21.150
Hey, Sou-chan, Subaru!

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:22.490
About those documents I asked for—

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.420
Geh, Yuu-kun.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:26.640
What documents?

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:30.280
The one who left that serial burglar

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:33.760
hanging from the pedestrian bridge 
with a no pants was you, wasn't it?

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:36.100
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:37.360
How awful.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.580
The burglar that Mikazuki 
asked us to look into?

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:41.830
That was a thing, wasn't it.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.480
Sou-chan, shh! Shh!

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:46.500
One of these days, I'll arrest you.

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:51.360
Well, Sou-chan, I'm borrowing 
Subaru and heading out.

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.320
Sure.

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:53.960
Please excuse me.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.300
Hoshikawa and Mikazuki are going out?

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:00.300
Well, I'm not really sure.

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:03.270
Nagumo-san, what was that about documents?

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:05.840
It's data on the members of a scam group.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:08.800
Amamiya, you want to go grab a bite to eat?

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:09.900
Oh, sure.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.570
<b>Daily Special Restaurant Hana</b>

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.450
Hiwatari's the same as ever, huh?

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.420
She's a slave-driver.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.950
I finished the deliveries.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.620
m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 28 l 0 28

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.620
Akane Taiyou (22)

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.620
Oh, Amamiya-san, Nagumo-san, welcome.

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:22.250
Hey, Akane-kun.

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:23.330
Good work with your job.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.040
Mmm.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.950
Sorano-san, I'm back.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.370
Welcome back.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.820
I finished making the staff meals,

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:30.500
m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 28 l 0 28

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:30.500
Sorano Hanako (28)

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:30.500
so close the door and take a break.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.350
Got it.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.880
Honestly, Akane-kun has changed.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.070
Yeah.

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:40.000
It's like he's lost a few screws after 
spending a year off to get into college.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.080
But why the Hawaiian shirts?

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.600
Hiwatari

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.490
Hiwatari-san...

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.060
Hello?

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:51.510
<i>Amamiya, if you're free, 
head over to Professor Shimaki's place.</i>

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:53.100
I'm not free.

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:54.650
<i>It's for work, go.</i>

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:55.810
Yes.

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:57.760
Sorano-san, check please.

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:00.150
You're leaving already?

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:02.330
I have to go to Shimaki-san's now.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.980
Oh, I need to turn my report in, too.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.120
Thank you for the food.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.840
Amamiya-san, I'll come with you.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:11.970
Go on, then.

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:13.510
Give Shimaki-san my regards.

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:14.540
'Kay!

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:19.620
My, Amamiya-kun, Akane-kun, hello.

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:21.300
m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 28 l 0 28

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:21.300
Shimaki Hyou (37)

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:21.300
m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 28 l 0 28

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:21.300
Shimaki Yayoi (Maiden Name: Hakudou) (33)

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:21.300
Hey, you two.

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:22.670
Hello.

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:25.630
What are you doing here, Missus Shimaki?

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:28.960
I'm delivering Hyou-san's lunch.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.750
You're a big help, Yayoi-san.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:31.540
Hm?

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:33.040
You're such a forgetful man.

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:34.230
Yeah, they got married last year.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.230
You two are always so in love!

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:35.680
Hmm?

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:38.860
How did that happen?

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:40.580
Ten years passed.

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:41.830
A lot can happen.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.890
Here you go.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:45.200
<b>Mental Care
of the Perpetrator's Family and Children</b>

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:47.990
My professional opinion on the mental care 
of the perpetrator's family and children.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:50.350
It's what Hiwatari-san asked me for.

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:51.920
Thank you very much.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:54.340
Akane-kun, is your report finished?

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:56.500
Oh, yes. Somehow.

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:59.920
Next time, finish on time.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:01.220
Yes.

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.130
Yoohoo, Taiyou!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:07.060
I went to the restaurant and 
Hanako-san said you were at the college.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:07.060
m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 28 l 0 28

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:07.060
Tsukishiro Yukimachi (24)

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.290
Yuki-san, what about school?

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:10.730
Today was a half day.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.310
Shimaki Hyou is a college professor.

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.150
Hakudou Yayoi is a housewife.

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.170
Tsukishiro Yukimachi 
is a middle school teacher, huh?

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:19.570
It's very much like them.

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:20.970
Yeah, it is.

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:24.920
By the way, Tsukishiro-san 
and Taiyou are dating.

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.000
Amamiya.

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:29.150
I know.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:30.950
Now I'll tell you...

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.370
about her.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:37.050
She fought her illness 
for eight years after that,

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:39.930
and two years ago she had 
her final operation.

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:45.300
The surgeon was her mother, Asahina Haruko.

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:47.980
Good job. How'd it go?

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.390
It's a success!

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:54.980
I see! Way to go, Miss God Hands.

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:58.420
No, this was the work of man.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:02.350
After the surgery, she spent two 
years recuperating in France.

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:04.320
She's coming back home to Japan today.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:08.430
My princess, Asahina Samidare, 
is alive and well.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:11.800
I see. Samidare was cured?

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:15.100
Hey, why did you choose Sami 
to be the princess?

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:16.470
"Sami", huh?

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:18.220
Don't tease me.

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:20.170
You wouldn't understand if I explained.

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:21.710
It was the flow of destiny.

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:26.300
Well, it's almost time for us to part.

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:28.970
I'm glad we got to talk.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:33.640
I'll do what I can to make sure we win 
the last battle and arrive at your future.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.560
Yeah, I know you will.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:40.650
Hey!

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:43.440
Yuu-kun, I'm home.

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:44.810
Welcome home.

00:21:44.810 --> 00:21:46.840
Hey. Did you get time off work?

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:48.410
I'm heading right back to it.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:49.780
Have you been doing well?

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.460
Yeah. You?

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:55.140
I'm invincible!

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:57.850
She's doing so well I don't know what to do.

00:21:57.850 --> 00:22:00.410
Lately she's been running
 ten kilometers a day.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:01.490
Huh?

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:02.960
I'm going to be in the Olympics!

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:06.760
My goal is to enter every 
event and win the gold!

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:11.430
As expected from you, my lord.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:13.560
I'll spend my life supporting you.

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:17.240
<i>Spend my life...</i>

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:21.360
<i>Every day that I couldn't 
see her, I thought about it.</i>

00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:23.400
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:25.040
<i>I'm with you.</i>

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:28.560
<i>Both myself and this planet exist for you.</i>

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:31.270
<i>Even if you don't shatter it,</i>

00:22:31.270 --> 00:22:33.200
<i>you're free to believe that.</i>

00:22:34.380 --> 00:22:37.830
<i>I'll become a hero from nothing.</i>

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:37.830
<i>In August of that same year,</i>

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:40.380
<i>we all gathered together 
at that same beach again.</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:44.280
<i>Both for our annual drinking party 
and to celebrate Sami's full recovery.</i>

00:22:44.280 --> 00:22:46.230
<i>Nagumo-san footed the bill.</i>

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:50.590
<i>Apparently, he used his wish ten 
years ago to win the lottery.</i>

00:22:48.290 --> 00:22:50.590
<i>Hey, you know, I wish</i>

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:53.170
Princess, are you able to drink now?

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:54.130
<i>I was the only person in the world.</i>

00:22:53.170 --> 00:22:54.000
Yeah.

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.530
I'm aiming to enter the drinking 
contest event at the Olympics, too!

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>I didn't want to learn I was all alone.</i>

00:22:56.530 --> 00:22:58.350
There is no such event.

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:01.360
<i>Ahh, I'm so empty</i>

00:22:59.550 --> 00:23:02.690
Oh, yeah, I have presents for you, 
now that we're all together.

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:04.730
<i>and I just wanted to shine, 
but I'm so weak.</i>

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:03.980
Oh!

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:09.500
<i>I was waiting for the courage 
to stop my trembling.</i>

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:12.060
<i>I looked up at the sky I couldn't fly in</i>

00:23:12.060 --> 00:23:14.440
<i>To avoid getting hurt.</i>

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:19.430
<i>But now it's goodbye to that old me.</i>

00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:18.430
<i>Ten years ago, we were a group 
of psychic-powered individuals</i>

00:23:18.430 --> 00:23:19.870
<i>calling ourselves the Beast Knights,</i>

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:24.690
<i>We smiled, we cried, and 
I learned another side of you.</i>

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:25.550
<i>and we fought against the mage, Animus, 
and his golems to protect the Earth.</i>

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:28.140
<i>The pain you hide, what hides 
behind your smile, this world,</i>

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:27.960
<i>During that battle, there was a third party</i>

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:29.940
<i>secretly plotting 
to destroy the Earth, as well,</i>

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.020
<i>I'll destroy it all,</i>

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>So I'll run, and I'll fall, 
and I'll still rise up again,</i>

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:34.350
<i>and the tale about shattering 
the planet lasted roughly a year.</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:39.760
<i>Because tonight I'm coming to save you.</i>

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:38.670
<i>Even though such 
an incredible tale took place,</i>

00:23:38.670 --> 00:23:40.660
<i>it still ended,</i>

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:44.500
<i>I'll become a hero from nothing.</i>

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:45.560
<i>and we continue to live our lives 
like normal ten whole years later.</i>

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:52.130
<i>We can become heroes, even from nothing.</i>

00:23:46.580 --> 00:23:49.190
<i>We've gained friends whom we 
can trust with our lives,</i>

00:23:50.130 --> 00:23:52.700
<i>and our story still continues.</i>

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:09.070
<i>Though, now we're all a little more grown up.</i>
